  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/banner.png\" alt=\"Slim Fire 横幅\"></p>\n<h2><strong>简介</strong></h2>\n<p>减少火焰覆盖层所占用的视觉空间！<br>\n非常适合 PvP 或日常游玩！</p>\n<p>唯一官方支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a> 及所有使用它的模组的资源包！</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原版</strong>:<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/fire-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim Fire\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/lava-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim Lava\"></li>\n<li><strong>Soul Fire'd</strong>:<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/soul-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim Soul\"></li>\n<li><strong>Soul Fire'd</strong> + <strong>Oh the Biomes You'll Go</strong>:<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/boric-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim Boric\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/slim-fire/imgs/cryptic-comparison.png\" alt=\"Slim Cryptic\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>许可与使用权</strong></h2>\n<p>欢迎在任何整合包或视频中使用本资源包，只需注明出处并附上 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/slim-fire#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处链接</a>。<br>\n本项目采用 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/slim-fire/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest 社区许可证 v1</a> 发布。</p>\n<h2><strong>支持我们</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 官网\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"我们的其他项目\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
